{"title":"2024 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(not_recommended)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (not recommended)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊_👍\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊 👍</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle(Goes_Through_Full_Thought_Process)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle(Goes Through Full Thought Process)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks_Now\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks_Now</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(MATH-X)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (MATH-X)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Quick_and_Easy!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Quick and Easy!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of this expression in decimal form?\n</p>\n<pre><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/7/5c7e5b58fa8556742330357616baa41f8daabd7a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{44}{11} + \\frac{110}{44} + \\frac{44}{1100}\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"37\" />\n</pre>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d56672ca5f629c2359c27c6db2dffdfab09245c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 6.4\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 6.504\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 6.54\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 6.9\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 6.94$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"462\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/6/3c68a24d945a5ec1351120f364e0788aeb9f9c03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{44}{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b69f70a8e58bebe27fd05341ec56a78501a49cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{110}{44}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3adf28c1ab96fc4eddaa890ec574e4cea2caea36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40cba44ffc429fc98e11a1605ced22243b655f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />; \n</p><p>and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96eac902689137fa4e68be9fc1564a58455467c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{44}{1100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf22b5f15c480811167e502caba25399206589ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/a/81a1aae7bfaea5dffa47e20e7ceb9c10401f0c03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.04$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />; \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/9709198656457140e59c6b678a9fedf750033196.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+2.5+0.04$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" /> reveals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/7/5c7e5b58fa8556742330357616baa41f8daabd7a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{44}{11} + \\frac{110}{44} + \\frac{44}{1100}\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"37\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/1/4a1a0b91c1544ed7a52152835f5f4ef5e1daa637.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)\\ 6.54}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"73\" height=\"30\" />. \n~ \n</p><p>~Minor Formatting by GreenPlanet2050\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28not_recommended.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(not_recommended)\">Solution 2 (not recommended)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (not recommended)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using brute force we can make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/6/3c68a24d945a5ec1351120f364e0788aeb9f9c03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{44}{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a020493cb0a917a1939ad4c7d2156d6fe14d79fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4400}{1100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b69f70a8e58bebe27fd05341ec56a78501a49cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{110}{44}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/7/a87f178541c820728cd1cc83b48fc7cc4f6a4932.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2750}{1100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96eac902689137fa4e68be9fc1564a58455467c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{44}{1100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" />, and then we add and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/3/953cc2d835712635aa27972547ad07ce78dbcf6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7194}{1100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" /> and this simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/1/4a1a0b91c1544ed7a52152835f5f4ef5e1daa637.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)\\ 6.54}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"73\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~VersatileGopher38\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bSPWqeNO11M?si=HIzlxPjMfvGM5lxR\">https://youtu.be/bSPWqeNO11M?si=HIzlxPjMfvGM5lxR</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3MtJRXIIxyM\">https://youtu.be/3MtJRXIIxyM</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28Detailed_Explanation.29_.F0.9F.9A.80.E2.9A.A1.F0.9F.93.8A_.F0.9F.91.8D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊_👍\">Video Solution 1 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊 👍</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊 👍\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Youtube Link ⬇️\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tLcIeR_Bg58\">https://youtu.be/tLcIeR_Bg58</a>\n</p><p>~ ChillGuyDoesMath&#160;:)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle.28Goes_Through_Full_Thought_Process.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle(Goes_Through_Full_Thought_Process)\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle(Goes Through Full Thought Process)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle(Goes Through Full Thought Process)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LoRrSfYvM9g\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LoRrSfYvM9g</a>\n</p><p>~mr_mathman\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks_Now\">Video by MathTalks_Now</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks_Now\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=crn37TRMLv4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=crn37TRMLv4</a>\n</p><p>-rc1219\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28MATH-X.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(MATH-X)\">Video Solution by Math-X (MATH-X)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (MATH-X)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=noTBPTosCtH31CpW&amp;t=287\">https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=noTBPTosCtH31CpW&amp;t=287</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5ZIFnqymdDQ?si=-FCGnA5WXQNp-JMF&amp;t=175\">https://youtu.be/5ZIFnqymdDQ?si=-FCGnA5WXQNp-JMF&amp;t=175</a>\n</p><p>~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Quick_and_Easy.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Quick_and_Easy!)\">Video Solution (Quick and Easy!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Quick and Easy!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nzPT89ymlKk\">https://youtu.be/nzPT89ymlKk</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=noTBPTosCtH31CpW&amp;t=287\">https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=noTBPTosCtH31CpW&amp;t=287</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/MasK0Z6wxR4\">https://youtu.be/MasK0Z6wxR4</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span